---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy · Bow Tie Kreative"
  description="This Privacy Policy explains how Bow Tie Kreative collects, uses, stores, and protects personal information when you visit bowtiekreative.com."
  canonical="https://bowtiekreative.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <section class="rp-section rp-backlight">
    <div class="rp-container">
      <div class="rp-legal">
        <span class="rp-eyebrow">Policies</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="rp-legal-date">Last updated: January 1, 2024</p>

        <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>Bow Tie Kreative ("we", "our", "us") is a creative agency based in Calgary, Alberta, Canada. We operate the website bowtiekreative.com. If you have any questions about this policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@bowtiekreative.com">hello@bowtiekreative.com</a>.</p>

        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Name, email address, phone number, and company details when you fill out our application form or contact us.</li>
          <li>Messages, project descriptions, and files you share during the inquiry or onboarding process.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We also collect information automatically:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use our site. This includes page views, session duration, device type, and approximate location (city-level).</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Essential cookies for site functionality. Non-essential cookies (analytics, marketing) require your consent. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and applications.</li>
          <li>Provide and improve our services.</li>
          <li>Send service-related communications.</li>
          <li>Analyze and improve our website performance and user experience.</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Legal Basis (GDPR)</h2>
        <p>If you are in the European Economic Area, we process your data based on:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Consent:</strong> For analytics cookies and marketing communications.</li>
          <li><strong>Contract:</strong> To fulfil our services to you.</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> To improve our services and website security.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with trusted third-party service providers who help us operate our website and business (e.g., Google Analytics, payment processors, email services). These providers are contractually bound to protect your data.</p>

        <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your personal data for as long as necessary to provide services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements. Analytics data is retained for 26 months.</p>

        <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access the personal data we hold about you.</li>
          <li>Request correction or deletion of your data.</li>
          <li>Object to or restrict processing of your data.</li>
          <li>Data portability.</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent at any time (without affecting the lawfulness of processing based on consent before its withdrawal).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:hello@bowtiekreative.com">hello@bowtiekreative.com</a>.</p>

        <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use cookies for essential site functions (session management, security), analytics (GA4), and marketing. You can manage your cookie preferences through our cookie consent banner. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

        <h2>9. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites (PayPal, social media, etc.). We are not responsible for their privacy practices. We encourage you to review their policies.</p>

        <h2>10. Security</h2>
        <p>We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information, including encryption in transit (HTTPS) and access controls. No method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>

        <h2>11. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our services are not directed to individuals under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

        <h2>12. International Transfers</h2>
        <p>Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your own. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for such transfers.</p>

        <h2>13. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.</p>

        <h2>14. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related inquiries:<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:hello@bowtiekreative.com">hello@bowtiekreative.com</a><br />
        Address: Calgary, Alberta, Canada</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .rp-legal {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .rp-legal h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .rp-legal-date {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .rp-legal h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-7);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
  }
  .rp-legal p {
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
  .rp-legal ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .rp-legal ul li {
    padding: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-2) var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .rp-legal ul li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--rp-accent);
  }
</style>